s the same cliques. O(n + m) before the first clique, O(d·n·3^(d\/3)) in all for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"degeneracy d.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MaximalCliques","kind":"identifier"}]}}}